#. module: interior_design
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:interior_design.homepage
msgid ""
"With a passion for transforming spaces, we create\n"
"                                            stunning interiors that reflect your\n"
"                                            personal style. Our focus is on blending aesthetics with\n"
"                                            functionality, ensuring that\n"
"                                            every room is not only beautiful but also livable. Each\n"
"                                            project is tailored to meet your\n"
"                                            unique vision while enhancing the overall ambiance of\n"
"                                            your home."
msgstr ""
"私たちは空間を劇的に生まれ変わらせる情熱をもって、\n"
"                                            お客様のライフスタイルや個性を反"
"映した\n"
"                                            美しいインテリアを創り出します。"
"美しさと\n"
"                                            機能性の融合を追求し、\n"
"                                            どの部屋も美しいだけでなく、住み"
"やすい空間となるよう\n"
"                                            努めています。それぞれの\n"
"                                            プロジェクトは、お客様の\n"
